<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MAY 20.</title>
<headline>BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MAY 20.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bulgarian National Bank set</p>
<p>the following fixed exchange rates against the Bulgarian lev</p>
<p>for Tuesday, May 20:</p>
<p>(Previous in brackets)</p>
<p>    USD  1,674.70 (1,552.10)	CHF  1,176.20 (1,085.40)</p>
<p>    DEM    983.61 (912.14)	  GBP  2,743.50 (2,545.30)</p>
<p>    ATS    139.76 (129.16)</p>
<p>Trading volume for Monday (total as dollar equivalent):</p>
<p>    Banks bought    $19.34 million</p>
<p>    Banks sold	$23.49 million</p>
<p>Total turnover  $42.83 million ($34.50 million)</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
